      "title": "Two placements of collective response",
      "question": "Which report does each controller consume?",
      "caption": "Lagged gradient matching updates theta from the old mismatch m-F(theta). The post-observation controller first advances x, then applies the collective response to x_next-b theta. Dashed equivalence is not asserted. These are different maps.",
